{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022093649327-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022164704\"/><p>廈門灣泳灘。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日(22日)宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘、石澳泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的三星灣泳灘、廈門灣泳灘、銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:50.093371+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:36:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:10.716401+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:10.716401+00:00","content_hash":"8c1150f4c9733a13603ef52f4eec7ecf530f714b3f783c622ecbf4f13342891a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}